# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BubbleScraper — Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values as needed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# DNS_MODE — Controls how Playwright's Chromium resolves domain names.
#
#   vpn  (DEFAULT)
#     Chromium uses the OS system DNS resolver.
#     Any VPN connected at the OS level is automatically respected —
#     no manual proxy setting required. Recommended for local dev or
#     when deploying behind a VPN/residential proxy.
#
#   doh
#     Chromium uses its own built-in DNS-over-HTTPS resolver (encrypted,
#     bypasses VPN DNS). Choose this when you do NOT use a VPN and want
#     faster, more private DNS resolution from Chromium itself.
#
# DNS_MODE=vpn

# PROXY_URL — (Optional) Explicit HTTP/SOCKS5 proxy for Playwright Chromium.
# Only needed if you want to route browser traffic through a specific proxy
# server rather than relying on OS-level VPN.
# Example: PROXY_URL=http://user:pass@proxy.example.com:8080
# Example: PROXY_URL=socks5://127.0.0.1:1080
#
# PROXY_URL=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Bright Data Web Unlocker (Optional)
# Routes ALL Playwright scrapers through Bright Data's residential proxy
# network, which bypasses bot detection on most sites.
#
# Steps:
#  1. Sign up at https://brightdata.com
#  2. Create a "Web Unlocker" zone
#  3. Copy the zone credentials below
#
# BRIGHT_DATA_ENABLED=false
# BRIGHT_DATA_PROXY=http://brd.superproxy.io:22225
# BRIGHT_DATA_USERNAME=brd-customer-XXXXXX-zone-web_unlocker
# BRIGHT_DATA_PASSWORD=your-bright-data-password
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ListClean Email Verification API (Optional)
# When set, the email verifier uses full SMTP + risk-signal verification
# instead of the local DNS MX record check (which is the free fallback).
#
# Get an API key at https://listclean.xyz
#
# LISTCLEAN_API_KEY=your-listclean-api-key
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Webhook / Automation (Optional)
# When set, results from every scraper run are automatically POSTed to this URL.
# Works with Zapier, Make (Integromat), n8n, or any HTTP endpoint.
#
# Payload: { tool, count, results[], timestamp }
#
# WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/...
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Envato License (set automatically via the dashboard activation page)
# These values are written when you enter your Envato purchase code in the
# dashboard. You should not need to edit them manually.
#
# ENVATO_PURCHASE_CODE=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
# ENVATO_VERIFIED_AT=2025-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mistral AI (Required for AI Auto-Pilot)
# Provide your Mistral API key here to allow the AI Agent router to function.
#
# Get your key at https://console.mistral.ai/
#
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=your-mistral-api-key
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WhatsApp Bulk Sender — Security Secret (Required for human approval tokens)
# A random secret used to sign HMAC-SHA256 confirmation tokens that gate bulk
# message dispatch. Generate with: node -e "require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex')|xargs echo"
# If not set, a new random key is generated at startup (tokens won't survive restarts).
#
# WA_SECURITY_SECRET=your-random-32-byte-hex-secret
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
